# Who owns which files. GitHub reads this file by itself.
#
# The pattern * matches every file in the repository, so the author owns all
# of it. Together with the rule "Require review from Code Owners" on the
# branch main, this means that a pull request cannot be merged until
# @MarkusFerdinandDablander has approved it. An approval by anybody else does
# not satisfy the rule.
#
# Without this file, "require 1 approval" would accept an approval from any
# person with write access to the repository, which is not what is wanted
# here.
#
# A later line wins over an earlier one. There is deliberately no more
# specific line below: every path is owned by the same person.

* @MarkusFerdinandDablander
